data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"### openzeppelin-contracts@5.x::BridgeERC20::__contract__\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/contracts/crosschain/bridges/BridgeERC20.sol#L19-L42\n\n```\nabstract contract BridgeERC20 is BridgeFungible {\n    using SafeERC20 for IERC20;\n```\n\n### 132c5b42-d4e0-5b7f-9faf-96812c7ad72d\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L20-L20\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Overview\n```\n\n### 7a5f1eaa-c990-5118-9746-7ea5fa7f4220\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L32-L32\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Overview › Installation\n```\n\n### 1832d834-8435-5338-8a08-c7933a4deffe\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L115-L117\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › License\nOpenZeppelin Contracts is released under the [MIT License](LICENSE).\n```\n\n### 291871e5-56c0-522a-bb6f-1c27e7cbc01e\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L119-L121\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Legal\nYour use of this Project is governed by the terms found at www.openzeppelin.com/tos (the \"Terms\").\n```\n\n### 11b9734e-4084-556d-aa8c-db9c5f8313f0\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L34-L44\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Overview › Installation › Hardhat (npm)\n```\n$ npm install @openzeppelin/contracts\n```\n→ Installs the latest audited release (`latest`).\n\n```\n$ npm install @openzeppelin/contracts@dev\n```\n→ Installs the latest unaudited release (`dev`).\n```\n\n### 173d12c0-4f59-5c2e-9488-97ad13f1153e\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L111-L113\n\n```\n<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Contribute\nOpenZeppelin Contracts exists thanks to its contributors. There are many ways you can participate and help build high quality software. Check out the [contribution guide](CONTRIBUTING.md)!\n```\n\n### openzeppelin-contracts@5.x::ERC1363ReturnFalseOnERC20Mock::__contract__\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/contracts/mocks/token/ERC1363ReturnFalseMock.sol#L8-L20\n\n```\nabstract contract ERC1363ReturnFalseOnERC20Mock is ERC1363 {\n    function transfer(address, uint256) public pure override(IERC20, ERC20) returns (bool) {\n```\n\n### openzeppelin-contracts@5.x::SafeERC20::SafeERC20FailedOperation\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/contracts/token/ERC20/utils/SafeERC20.sol#L20-L55\n\n```\nerror SafeERC20FailedOperation(address token);\nerror SafeERC20FailedDecreaseAllowance(address spender, uint256 currentAllowance, uint256 requestedDecrease);\nfunction safeTransfer(IERC20 token, address to, uint256 value) internal\n+2 more units in this chunk\n```\n\n### 788c4e47-3eff-547e-af61-097592d02c77\n`openzeppelin-contracts@5.x` · repo:bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40 · as_of 2026-08-03T16:17:02Z\nhttps://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/audits/2017-03.md#L1-L6\n\n```\nOpenZeppelin Audit\nNOTE ON 2021-07-19: This report makes reference to Zeppelin, OpenZeppelin, OpenZeppelin Contracts, the OpenZeppelin team, and OpenZeppelin library. Many of these things have since been renamed and know that this audit applies to what is currently called the OpenZeppelin…\n```"}],"structuredContent":{"intent":"lookup","recipe":null,"hits":[{"selector":"openzeppelin-contracts@5.x::BridgeERC20::__contract__","source_url":"https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/contracts/crosschain/bridges/BridgeERC20.sol#L19-L42","snippet":"abstract contract BridgeERC20 is BridgeFungible {\n    using SafeERC20 for IERC20;","project":"openzeppelin-contracts","version":"5.x","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-08-03T16:17:02Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40"},{"selector":"132c5b42-d4e0-5b7f-9faf-96812c7ad72d","source_url":"https://github.com/OpenZeppelin/openzeppelin-contracts/blob/bb8ed388b04690b09f8c36586f5cde9fdd67fb40/README.md#L20-L20","snippet":"<img src=\"logo.svg\" alt=\"OpenZeppelin\" height=\"40px\"> › Overview","project":"openzeppelin-contracts","version":"5.x","version_defaulted":false,"last_validated":"2026-08-13T03:54:35Z","as_of":"2026-08-03T16:17:02Z","provenance_kind":"repo","pin_ref":"bb8ed388b04690